==Battleground==
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>.
*1 [[Relic Doge]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Wicked Face]] spawns as the boss after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*2 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
*3 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Loris]] spawns after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]]; he's absurdly strong in stages with mixed [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] and [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] enemies. A few [[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|anti-Angel specialists]], such as [[Phantom Cat (Rare Cat)|Bubble Cat]] and [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]], are also recommended. Outside of that, bring a [[:Category:Shield Piercing Cats|Shield Piercer]] like [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Cat Researcher]] to quickly dispatch Wicked Face's [[Shield]].

